{"title": "Measure Before You Enter", "type": "One trick", "hooks": ["Never enter until the target is at least twice the stop.", "Don't place the trade until you've measured these two distances.", "Two distances decide a trade before you ever click."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Never enter until the target is at least twice the stop.", "text": "Target at least 2x the stop", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "A short setup", "vo": "Here's a short. The price kept failing under the same highs, and each bounce got a little weaker.", "cues": [{"say": "the same highs", "do": "mark", "i": 56, "label": "A", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "a little weaker", "do": "mark", "i": 87, "label": "B", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Reward to risk?", "vo": "Entry, stop and target are drawn. What's the reward-to-risk? One to one, one and a half, two, or three to one?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["1 to 1", "1.5 to 1", "2 to 1", "3 to 1"], "answer": 3, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 16.28, "label": "Entry", "tone": "entry"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 16.59, "label": "Stop-loss", "tone": "stop"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Three to one", "vo": "Three to one. The target was three times as far as the stop. Twenty-five candles later, it hit the target. Plus three R.", "cues": [], "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Wrong twice. Still break even.", "vo": "Here's why it works. At two to one, you can be wrong twice for every win and still break even, before fees.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "The one rule", "vo": "So measure two distances first. Entry to stop. Entry to target. And only count a target the price can really reach.", "items": [{"text": "Entry to stop", "sub": "What you risk", "icon": "shield"}, {"text": "Entry to target", "sub": "What you aim for", "icon": "check"}, {"text": "A real target", "sub": "Somewhere price can reach", "icon": "idea"}], "cues": [{"say": "Entry to stop", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "Entry to target", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "can really reach", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Measure, then enter", "vo": "Save this, and practise measuring every trade at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Never enter until the target is at least twice the stop.\n\nThis short had a target three times as far as its stop.\nIt hit the target 25 candles later: plus 3R.\nAt 2 to 1 you can be wrong twice per win and still break even, before fees.\nOnly count a target the price can really reach.\n\nSave this for your next trade.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #RiskReward #TradingTips #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[15.93, 15.93, 15.79, 15.8, 3578901], [15.74, 16.51, 15.66, 16.46, 23198511], [16.45, 16.58, 16.15, 16.23, 17159865], [16.22, 16.46, 16.21, 16.32, 10846679], [16.31, 16.51, 16.28, 16.5, 8255036], [16.5, 16.51, 16.45, 16.47, 3444073], [16.47, 16.5, 16.45, 16.46, 1862515], [16.45, 16.45, 16.21, 16.21, 17831233], [16.23, 16.41, 16.17, 16.32, 17598274], [16.34, 16.4, 16.15, 16.16, 8637026], [16.16, 16.35, 16.15, 16.28, 9047486], [16.28, 16.28, 16.23, 16.23, 2225928], [16.23, 16.28, 16.23, 16.28, 1116935], [16.33, 16.33, 15.96, 15.96, 7062906], [15.97, 16.22, 15.91, 16.19, 4758209], [16.19, 16.42, 16.15, 16.42, 4136381], [16.42, 16.54, 16.37, 16.51, 4170256], [16.51, 16.51, 16.4, 16.4, 1645051], [16.4, 16.41, 16.28, 16.3, 1493594], [16.28, 16.85, 16.24, 16.72, 15094768], [16.72, 16.82, 16.72, 16.72, 2853278], [16.73, 16.84, 16.71, 16.83, 2213662], [16.83, 16.88, 16.75, 16.76, 3200597], [16.76, 16.78, 16.74, 16.75, 1289274], [16.75, 16.78, 16.75, 16.78, 957533], [16.75, 16.76, 16.29, 16.29, 6686314], [16.28, 16.43, 16.24, 16.36, 78082